# Whoever drives the truck. They sit in it until they get out (hold E, or the bottom button on
# a controller, in free roam): then they are an eye on legs, walking, and the truck stands on
# its handbrake until they get back in the same way. There is no body to see yet.
name driver
script driver.star
property walk_speed float 1.8   # metres a second
property run_speed float 4.6
property jump_speed float 4.7   # metres a second off the ground: a jump of about a metre
property sprinting float 0      # 1 while running was switched on, on a controller
camera 0 1.68 0
character 0.3 1.78
